WEBVTT

20:31.673 --> 20:33.258
How did you know I was coming?

20:33.383 --> 20:35.719
Knowledge is my trade, my lady.

20:37.596 --> 20:40.015
Did you bring the dagger with you,
by any chance?

20:41.683 --> 20:43.977
My little birds are everywhere...

20:44.102 --> 20:46.271
even in the North.

20:46.396 --> 20:49.817
They whisper to me
the strangest stories.

20:55.280 --> 20:57.282
Valyrian steel.

20:57.407 --> 21:00.118
Do you know whose dagger this is?
